{"4789900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Queen's Gondola", "steam_appid": 4789900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE GODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen's Gondola is a cozy horror anomaly game inspired by Victorian and Art Nouveau aesthetics, set in a dark elven fantasy world influenced by Eldritch horror. Having snuck aboard a regal airship with a noble goal in mind, you have been trapped in an eerie loop by a supernatural snare. Observe your environment to find an escape, and fulfill your mission as a loyal patron of the realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND ANOMALIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fool. You are trapped here...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unless you spot the anomalies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You know how the saying goes;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn around, when you see wrong,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If all is clear, then carry along.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-60 mins</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature list</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautifully high quality hand crafted environment to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of subtle to terrifying anomalies all inspired by Eldritch horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative that weaves through the game as you proceed successfully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling atmosphere throughout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in English and French - but the core gameplay is mostly visual</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE GODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen's Gondola is a cozy horror anomaly game inspired by Victorian 